Third-Party Font Files

The `.FON` binary files in this repository may originate from legacy operating
systems, software packages, vendors, or other third parties. Copyright,
trademark, redistribution, installation, and usage rights for those font files
remain with their respective owners.

No ownership claim or new license is granted for third-party font binaries by
this repository. Before copying, installing, packaging, publishing, or using a
font file, independently verify its source, authenticity, compatibility, and
license terms. Remove or report any file that appears unauthorised, corrupted,
mislabelled, or unsafe.
